{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":null,"for_seq":3,"result_bytes":1807,"result_hash":"sha256:cdc7f7acfb62ab8a443293dc7f674e6cb5ef44047cb71cf959857ff831de333b","result_inline":"{\"interrupted\":false,\"isImage\":false,\"noOutputExpected\":false,\"stderr\":\"\",\"stdout\":\"# Contract: exponential backoff with jitter\\n\\n<!-- canary: 52aeff4aebe362eb -->\\nREQUEST: sha256:11f3c8fdc74f86458dfb8890fc9d4de540d5d86d1ce7cbe152f6587ddc0109d7\\nIN: src/retry.ts\\nOUT: test/**, package.json, README.md\\n\\n- [ ] G1: the visible retry test passes unmodified\\n    CHECK: git diff --quiet HEAD -- test && node --test --test-reporter=tap \\\"test/**/*.test.ts\\\"\\n    EXPECT: /^# fail 0$/m\\n    FROM: R3 \\\"Make retry honour the documented backoff\\\"\\n    FROM: R4 \\\"Keep the test file as it is\\\"\\n- [ ] G2: with r = 0 the waits are exactly baseMs * 2^i\\n    CHECK: node -e \\\"import('./src/retry.ts').then(async m=>{const w=[];await m.retry(async()=>{throw new Error('x')},{attempts:4,baseMs:100,sleep:async ms=>{w.push(ms)},random:()=>0}).catch(()=>{});console.log(w.join(','))})\\\"\\n    EXPECT: /^100,200,400$/m\\n    FROM: R2 \\\"The README says waits are baseMs * 2^i * (1 + r)\\\"\\n---\\n./.saga/trace/pins/current.json\\n./.saga/trace/prices/869ccc57ac8cc9de882f05d4f768dee01fbf7191ce30532635fba38c4cfa339a.toml\\n./.saga/trace/sessions/bde4bb6f-9012-4e15-a2eb-3ca413123f71/events.000001.jsonl\\n./.saga/trace/sessions/bde4bb6f-9012-4e15-a2eb-3ca413123f71/LOCK\\n./.saga/evidence/exponential-backoff-with-jitter/G2.json\\n./.saga/evidence/exponential-backoff-with-jitter/G1.json\\n./.saga/contract.md\\n./.saga/red/exponential-backoff-with-jitter/G2.json\\n./.saga/red/exponential-backoff-with-jitter/G1.json\\n./.saga/.gitignore\\n./.saga/snap/last-local.json\\n./.saga/manifest.json\\n./.saga/config.toml\\n./.saga/request.md\\n./.saga/observed/session-bde4bb6f-9012-4e15-a2eb-3ca413123f71.json\\n./.saga/observed/gate-bde4bb6f-9012-4e15-a2eb-3ca413123f71.json\\n./test/r